tion sur l'innovation destiné","  aux chercheurs, aux inventeurs et aux","entrepreneurs.","----------------------------------------","  APHP  1,24","  Hôpitaux et services de l'AP-HP :","fiche signalétique des","  établissements, guide du malade,","informations médicales divers.","----------------------------------------","  BATIBASE  2,30","  Banque de données de l'ITB (Institut","Technique du Bâtiment) et du","  CSTB (Centre Scientifique et Technique","du Bâtiment) sur les produits","  et les fabricants du secteur de la","construction. Consultation en","  français et en anglais.","----------------------------------------","  BIBDENT  1,24","  Banque de données bibliographiques","francophone en odontostoma-","  tologie.","----------------------------------------","  CEDIM  1,51","  Centre Européen de Documentation et","d'Information Mer proposant une","  approche du milieu maritime dans les","domaines scientifique,","  technique, écologique, culturel,","économique et commercial.","----------------------------------------","  CHIMITEL  5,15","  Banque de données Chimitel : ensemble","des intervenants et chiffres","  concernant le domaine de l'industrie","chimique.","----------------------------------------","  DEFITH  2,30","  Service du comité de développement et","de promotion du textile et de","  l'habillement. Il recense des","informations sectorielles sur 80 pays.","----------------------------------------","  DIETEL  1,24","  Catalogue de plus de 1 500 aliments","avec leur composition, conseils","  diététiques.","----------------------------------------","  ENERSTAT  2,30","  Accès aux derniers chiffres du secteur","de l'énergie (pétrole,","  charbon, gaz, électricité). Recherche","par critère ou par mot.","----------------------------------------","  EMC  5,15","  Banque de données bibliographiques","recensant 700 000 références de","  périodiques médicaux depuis 1982.","Interrogation possible en français","  ou en anglais.","---------------------------------